/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/
# The B15 cold-start measurement, rewritten on every run. It is a same-machine
# trend line, not a committed baseline -- committing it would produce a diff on
# every run and invite someone to "fix" a number by editing the file.
/worker-cold-start.json
